            <note corresp="#ch21subch5-f1" n="73" type="source" xml:id="ch21subch5-f1-content">
                <p>For previous correspondence respecting claims of the United States against
                    Germany, see <ref target="frus1937v02#pg_348"><hi rendition="#italic">Foreign
